- Direct erased statement `arbitrary::<!>(); consume(t); consume(t);`: REJECTED.
- Braced erased statement `{ arbitrary::<!>(); } consume(t); consume(t);`: REJECTED.
- Nested tail block `{ { arbitrary::<!>(); } } consume(t); consume(t);`: VERIFIED incorrectly.
- Valid single consume after ghost never call: VERIFIED.
- Real `return; consume(t); consume(t);`: generator SOUND probe expected VERIFY.

